          [UpgradeTypes](./DataTables/UpgradeTypes.asset): All available upgrade
          types (readonly).

          - [Upgrades](./DataTables/Upgrades.asset):
          All available upgrades (readonly).

          - UpgradeProgress: A DataTable
          on this [GameObject](go:LevelUp UI) that tracks the level for each upgrade
          type.


